<https://hexplain.io/ns/core> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Properties linking the physical, layout, and semantic layers of the Hexplain framework."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/core> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Import to link a physical description (bddo, dlv) to the RDF it emits: class and property mappings, conditional mappings, computed values, encoding pipelines, register bindings and the register lifecycle. It adds no byte-layout terms of its own."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/core#ClassMappingRule> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A rule selecting the owl:Class a bddo:Struct represents based on a discriminator condition; used in a hexplain:hasConditionalClassMapping list to model tagged unions / variant records."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/core#ClassMappingRule> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Assert on each member of a hexplain:hasConditionalClassMapping list, with one hexplain:condition and one hexplain:semanticClass. Rules are tried in list order; the first whose condition holds decides the struct's class."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/core#ClassMappingRuleShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A reusable validation contract for hexplain:condition, hexplain:semanticClass. Its constraints below specify the permitted values and combinations."@en .
